#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/spi.md:10
msgid "SPI controllers, transactions and DMA"
msgstr "SPI 控制器、事务与 DMA"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/spi.md:12
msgid ""
"Controller identity, child endpoint identity and transaction ownership are "
"distinct. Select the endpoint traits and finite transfer path before "
"admitting a transaction; DMA completion does not establish wire completion "
"or final buffer access."
msgstr "控制器身份、子端点身份和事务所有权彼此独立。事务准入前选择端点特征及有限传输路径；DMA 完成不代表线缆传输完成或缓冲区最终访问。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/spi.md:17
msgid "Public declarations"
msgstr "公共声明"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/spi.md:19
msgid "spi.h"
msgstr "spi.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/spi.md:21
msgid "Single-executor polling SPI endpoints and complete CS transactions."
msgstr "单执行者轮询 SPI 端点与完整 CS 事务。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/spi.md:21
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/spi.md:27
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/spi.md:33
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/spi.md:39
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/spi.md:45
